              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tek. 18.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man en kite ame rik tic luŋ ame abaka Culeman otio i kom ot a Rwot otum kede. Culeman te daŋ kelo jami luŋ ame rik pappere Daudi ojalo baŋ Rwot iye; okelo ryal, jabu, kede jami ocele luŋ acalo, tabbi, cupa, kopo, te kanogi luŋ i ot kano lim a Rwot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
